### Update an organization

```
Example Request
```

```shell
curl "https://api.example.org/v3/organizations/[guid]" \
  -X PATCH \
  -H "Authorization: bearer [token]" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{ "name": "my-organization" }'

```

```
Example Response
```

```http
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

<%= yield_content :organization %>
```

#### Definition
`PATCH /v3/organizations/:guid`

#### Optional parameters

Name | Type | Description
---- | ---- | -----------
**name** | _string_ | Organization name |
**suspended** | _boolean_ | Whether an organization is suspended or not
**service_account_prefix** | _string_ or _null_ | Admin only; allocate a prefix when currently unset. Must be an available lowercase RFC 1123 label of 3–63 characters with alphanumeric boundaries. Repeating the current value succeeds; changing or clearing an allocated prefix fails. Org rename does not change it; org deletion does not release it.
**metadata.labels** | [_label object_](#labels) | Labels applied to the organization
**metadata.annotations**  | [_annotation object_](#annotations) | Annotations applied to the organization

#### Permitted roles

Role | Notes
---- | -----
Admin |
Org Manager | Cannot change the `suspended` field or supply `service_account_prefix`
